$-- This extension loads its own inputenc/fontenc/fonts (see
$-- partials/pdf/include-in-header.tex -- classic Type 1 fonts, no
$-- fontspec needed). Quarto's own default fonts.latex unconditionally
$-- loads `unicode-math` under LuaLaTeX/XeLaTeX, which silently breaks any
$-- macro sharing a name with a math operator (e.g. \mp, the
$-- minus-or-plus symbol) and breaks \euro (eurosym) immediately after
$-- math mode. Overriding this partial as a no-op avoids both instead of
$-- chasing every symbol unicode-math happens to also define.
